'W06.Tests.infoExample' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
W06.Tests.independentActions : ∃ x y, 0 ≤ x ∧ x ≤ 1 ∧ 0 ≤ y ∧ y ≤ 1 ∧ (x + (1 - y)) / 2 = 0 ∧ x ≠ y
